From 93b9ec27d355b41cbc28d31ceb2abcb982942aad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lesPrivilege <lesprivilege@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 18:21:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(attention): WO-ATT-UI02 candidate list-detail,
 disposition feedback and motion

Author candidate for Astra adjudication; not accepted, not merged.
- attention-view: query bar, seen beside status, decision block, actions before
  L3 context, receipt line, conflict version line, departed note, narrow round
  trip with scroll restore, focus fixes for in-flight and unknown results
- motion: token-driven WAAPI entries, both reduce paths, held until settled
- synthetic preview (mock core ported from attention.py), before/after
  captures, recordings, author browser checks and return docs

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
